---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Demo from '../components/Demo.astro';
import PhonePreview from '../components/PhonePreview.astro';
import { demoUrl } from '../config';
import BookingLink from '../components/BookingLink.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { pageUrl } from '../config';
const faqs = [
 ['Is CLOSEFLOW AI available now?', 'CLOSEFLOW AI is in prelaunch. A local, rules-based prototype is being tested with fictional conversations. The AI product and live integrations are not available. This page illustrates a proposed workflow; there is no live product, beta or early access to software. Availability, scope and onboarding will be confirmed before any purchase.'],
 ['Does this demo connect to Instagram?', 'No. It is a scripted simulation that runs only in your browser. It does not read your DMs, send messages, connect accounts or create calendar bookings. Any future integration would depend on supported APIs, permissions and platform requirements.'],
 ['Who is it being designed for?', 'Independent online fitness coaches and small coaching teams serving US and UK clients who want a more structured way to handle inbound coaching enquiries.'],
 ['Will it replace my judgement as a coach?', 'The intended workflow follows your approved coaching information and leaves sensitive questions, exceptions and final fit decisions with you. It is not designed to provide medical advice or make health assessments.'],
 ['How much will it cost?', 'Pricing and package details are not final. The free prelaunch call is a conversation about your workflow, not a live product demo or a commitment to buy. No payment is taken on this website.'],
 ['How do bookings and preview data work?', 'The scripted preview uses fictional content and does not submit or save lead data. The website code has no analytics or advertising trackers. The booking link opens Calendly, where you provide scheduling information to arrange a call with the operator. GitHub handles technical hosting information. Our Privacy Policy explains enquiries, bookings, providers and the six-month retention policy; linked provider notices explain their own practices.'],
];
---
<Layout>
 <Header />
 <main id="main">
 <section class="hero container"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> FITNESS COACHES · PRELAUNCH CONCEPT</p><h1>More coaching.<br />Less chasing <span class="serif">DMs.</span></h1><p class="hero-description">Your next coaching client starts with a conversation. Make it a better one.</p><p class="hero-detail">We’re exploring an AI appointment setter for inbound coaching enquiries, shaped around your playbook. We are testing a local, rules-based prototype with fictional conversations. The AI product and live integrations are not available. Explore the scripted concept or discuss your workflow with the founder.</p><div class="hero-actions"><BookingLink /><a class="text-link" href="#demo"><span class="play-icon" aria-hidden="true">▶</span> View scripted preview</a></div><p class="fine-print">For US & UK coaches. Local prototype in testing. No product access available.</p></div>
 <PhonePreview />
 </section>
 <div class="audience-strip"><div class="container"><span>MADE FOR THE WAY YOU COACH</span><p>Independent coaches</p><i aria-hidden="true">✳</i><p>Online programmes</p><i aria-hidden="true">✳</i><p>Small coaching teams</p></div></div>
 <section id="workflow" class="section container"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">LESS ADMIN. MORE INTENTION.</p><h2>You bring the expertise.<br />Give every enquiry a direction.</h2></div><p>Between check-ins, programming and client calls, your inbox can become another workout. Here’s the workflow we’re building towards.</p></div><div class="workflow-grid">{[
 ['01', 'Your voice, from the start.', 'The proposed assistant would use your approved offer, tone and answers. This is a design goal, not an available feature.', 'Your playbook →'],
 ['02', 'Context before the call.', 'The planned workflow would explore goals and coaching fit through questions approved by you, before suggesting a next step.', 'A clearer picture →'],
 ['03', 'A thoughtful next step.', 'We aim to support consultation handoffs and flag questions for a person. No messaging or calendar integration is operational today.', 'A human handoff ↗'],
 ].map(([number,title,text,caption]) => <article class="workflow-card"><span class="step-number">{number}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p><span class="card-caption">{caption}</span></article>)}</div><p class="fine-print section-note">Proposed capabilities. Final functionality and integrations are subject to development and validation.</p></section>
 <div class="container"><Demo /></div>
 <section class="principles-section"><div class="container principles-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">PURPOSEFUL BY DESIGN</p><h2>Your reputation<br />is part of the brief.</h2><p>Coaching is personal. The way you handle a first conversation should reflect that.</p><a class="text-link" href="#early-access">Let’s talk about your workflow <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="principle-list">{[
 ['01','Your offer. Your boundaries.','The local prototype uses a fictional coaching offer to test qualification rules. Real coaching playbooks and live use have not been validated.'],
 ['02','People before pressure.','A clear next step should help someone decide. No aggressive scripts, false urgency or guaranteed transformations.'],
 ['03','A coach when it matters.','Health concerns, sensitive questions and unusual requests belong with a person. Human escalation is part of the proposed design.'],
 ].map(([n,title,text]) => <article><span>{n}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></div></article>)}</div></div></section>
 <section id="faq" class="section container faq-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</p><h2>Clear answers.<br />No fine-print surprises.</h2><p>Early stage. Open about it.</p></div><div class="faq-list">{faqs.map(([q,a]) => <details><summary>{q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></section>
 <section id="contact" class="container section contact-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">CONTACT THE FOUNDER</p><h2>A real conversation.<br />Before a future product.</h2></div><div class="contact-copy"><p>CLOSEFLOW AI is a prelaunch project by <strong>Nikola Pešić</strong>, an individual based in Serbia, not a registered company.</p><p>Questions or privacy requests? <a href="mailto:nikolapesic878@gmail.com">nikolapesic878@gmail.com</a></p><p><a href={pageUrl("contact/")}>Contact and call details ↗</a></p></div></section>
 <section id="early-access" class="container cta-section"><div class="cta-content"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S BUILD A BETTER FIRST CONVERSATION</p><h2>Your next chapter<br />starts in the inbox.</h2><p>Book a free 15-minute conversation about the concept and your coaching workflow. This is not a live product demonstration or an offer of software access.</p>{demoUrl ? <BookingLink coral /> : <div class="prelaunch-notice"><b>Prelaunch calls opening soon.</b><p>We’re preparing the first concept conversations. In the meantime, <a href="#demo">explore the simulated product preview ↗</a>.</p></div>}<p class="booking-note">Booking opens Calendly. Please share business workflow questions only, not private client messages, passwords or health information. <a href={pageUrl("privacy/")}>Our Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="https://calendly.com/legal/privacy-notice">Calendly’s notice</a>.</p><p class="cta-fine">Prelaunch concept · No payment · No launch date or access guarantee</p></div><div class="cta-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</div></section>
 </main>
 <Footer />
</Layout>
